    {
      "id": "rules",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 338,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 33,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 269246,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794700000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rules the database enforces\n• every change: version + 1 and one\n  link_versions row, in one transaction\n• a link row is never deleted; deleted\n  is terminal; the slug is never reissued\n• the slug, id and domain never change\n\nRules the API enforces\n• a guest link is immutable until claimed\n• claim (Q07): owner set, proof consumed,\n  state unchanged, version + 1\n• owner enabling a blocked link:\n  409 blocked_by_operator\n• stale If-Match: 412; missing: 428\n\nExpiry is not a state\n• after expiresAt Redirect answers 410\n  while the state stays as it is",
      "originalText": "Rules the database enforces\n• every change: version + 1 and one\n  link_versions row, in one transaction\n• a link row is never deleted; deleted\n  is terminal; the slug is never reissued\n• the slug, id and domain never change\n\nRules the API enforces\n• a guest link is immutable until claimed\n• claim (Q07): owner set, proof consumed,\n  state unchanged, version + 1\n• owner enabling a blocked link:\n  409 blocked_by_operator\n• stale If-Match: 412; missing: 428\n\nExpiry is not a state\n• after expiresAt Redirect answers 410\n  while the state stays as it is",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "footer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 870,
      "width": 1300,
      "height": 18,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 34,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 277165,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794700000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q06 implements guest create (the entry arrow). Claim, owner edits, disable, enable and delete are Q07; block and unblock are Q09; Redirect's answers are Q08.",
      "originalText": "Q06 implements guest create (the entry arrow). Claim, owner edits, disable, enable and delete are Q07; block and unblock are Q09; Redirect's answers are Q08.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
